<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- Quantum HTML + CSS example 07_colors/02: Forest palette in rgb -->
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Forest palette in rgb</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #1f2933;
      background: #f5f7fa;
    }
    .demo { max-width: 60rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.25rem; }
    .demo > h1 { margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 2rem; }
    .lead { margin: 0 0 2rem; color: #52606d; }

    .swatches { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(9rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.5rem; }
    .swatches li { padding: 1.25rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 10px; }
    .swatches strong, .swatches code { display: block; }
    .swatches code { font-size: 0.75rem; opacity: 0.85; }
    .s100 { background: rgb(238 246 241); color: #111827; }
    .s200 { background: rgb(211 238 220); color: #111827; }
    .s300 { background: rgb(168 230 189); color: #111827; }
    .s400 { background: rgb(115 222 150); color: #111827; }
    .s500 { background: rgb(62 218 114); color: #111827; }
    .s600 { background: rgb(34 195 88); color: #ffffff; }
    .s700 { background: rgb(28 156 70); color: #ffffff; }
    .s800 { background: rgb(23 120 55); color: #ffffff; }
    .s900 { background: rgb(18 84 40); color: #ffffff; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="demo">
    <h1>Forest palette in rgb</h1>
    <p class="lead">Nine shades of hue 140&deg;, written in rgb notation.</p>
    <ul class="swatches">
      <li class="s100"><strong>100</strong><code>rgb(238 246 241)</code></li>
      <li class="s200"><strong>200</strong><code>rgb(211 238 220)</code></li>
      <li class="s300"><strong>300</strong><code>rgb(168 230 189)</code></li>
      <li class="s400"><strong>400</strong><code>rgb(115 222 150)</code></li>
      <li class="s500"><strong>500</strong><code>rgb(62 218 114)</code></li>
      <li class="s600"><strong>600</strong><code>rgb(34 195 88)</code></li>
      <li class="s700"><strong>700</strong><code>rgb(28 156 70)</code></li>
      <li class="s800"><strong>800</strong><code>rgb(23 120 55)</code></li>
      <li class="s900"><strong>900</strong><code>rgb(18 84 40)</code></li>
    </ul>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
